      en: ["The reserve primarily protects boreal forests on peat-rich soils.", "It is a designated Natura 2000 site of European importance.", "The area is home to rare orchid species sensitive to environmental changes.", "All commercial logging is strictly prohibited within the reserve boundaries.", "It serves as a natural laboratory for studying forest succession.", "The reserve helps maintain the groundwater level of the surrounding region."],
