      en: ["The Abava Valley was officially established as a nature park in 1999.", "The Sabile Wine Hill is listed in the Guinness World Records as the world's northernmost vineyard.", "The Abava caves, also called 'sandstone caves', extend for several meters.", "The Abava River is 129 kilometers long and flows into the Venta River.", "Over 50 protected plant species have been documented within the park boundaries.", "The highest point of the valley is approximately 100 meters above sea level."],
