      en: ["Lake Kanieris hosts 14 artificial islands used as nesting sites.", "The average depth of the lake is only about 0.6 meters.", "The area was added to the Ramsar Convention list in 1995.", "It is one of the best locations in Latvia for observing cranes in autumn.", "The Kanieris hillfort ruins from the Iron Age are located near the lake.", "There are a total of 5 bird watching towers around the body of water."],
