      en: ["The nature park was officially placed under protection in 2004.", "The area hosts one of the most significant European roller populations in the country.", "The forests grow on a relief of ancient inland dunes.", "The total area of the protected site is approximately 1,500 hectares.", "Pine trees make up the vast majority of the forest stock.", "The park grounds are located only about 20 kilometers northeast of Riga."],
